            "text": "For a shopper in Sydney, New South Wales, there are several excellent online options to buy bulk lollies, offering a wide variety and convenient delivery across the region.\n\nHere are some of the best places to consider:\n\n*   **Goody Goody Gum Drops** is a highly recommended online lolly shop for bulk purchases in Sydney and across NSW. They are a family-run business known for their huge selection of lollies, many of which are exclusive to them, and offer affordable delivery throughout Sydney and NSW. Their range includes single-coloured lollies for candy buffets, a wide variety of boiled lollies, Jelly Belly jelly beans, Australian-made chocolates, retro lollies, Allen's and Cadbury selections, gourmet rock candy, custom-made lollipops, and options for gluten-free and sugar-free lollies, all available at wholesale prices. They have been family-owned and run since 2006 and were recognized as \"Best Australian Online Confectionery Retailer\" in 2022 and 2026.\n*   **Candy Bar Sydney** is another top choice, especially if you're looking for wholesale prices on bulk lollies directly from a Sydney-based warehouse. They pride themselves on offering some of the cheapest wholesale prices in Australia for bulk confectionery and party supplies. They stock popular brands like Allen's (including Snakes Alive, Racing Cars, and Strawberries and Cream) and Nestle (such as Golden Rough, Mint Patties, and Kit Kats). They cater to various events, from candy buffets to large-scale events, and are known for their helpful customer service.\n*   **The Lolly Shop** provides overnight delivery to Sydney, Melbourne, and Brisbane, with most other suburbs receiving deliveries within two days. They offer a wide range of bulk lollies, including classic favourites, ideal for candy buffets and parties. They also offer wholesale access for registered retailers.\n*   **Bulk Lollies - Online Lolly Shop** delivers Australia-wide, including Sydney, and is known for its extensive range of bulk lollies at warehouse prices. They offer a vast selection, from gummy sweets and sour lollies to chocolates, licorice, mints, and novelty sweets, ensuring quality and taste.\n*   **SweetsWorld** is another excellent option for securing bulk candy deals in Australia. They offer a diverse range of popular wholesale confectionery, including classic Australian lollies like Allen's Fantales, and various chocolate and mint options. They provide cost-effective solutions for events and personal stocking up, delivering Australia-wide.\n*   **Lollyworld** offers bulk lollies and chocolates perfect for corporate events, marketing promotions, or parties, delivering across Australia.\n*   **Sweetcraft** is identified as Sydney's leading confectionery wholesaler, stocking all major brands of local and imported chocolates and candies. They are conveniently located in Lakemba and offer competitive prices for bulk lollies in metro Sydney."
          }
        ],
